      "contextFingerprint": "1096ce85218ca3667d5103e8c0c570581dfc09f6b5215a6e91a99254b895edef",
      "sourceText": "| 示例 | 讲了什么 | 新出现的语法 | 为什么这样写 | 注意事项 |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| 示例 1 | 从 `pair.first/second` 改为解包 pair | `auto [value, ok] = pair` | C++17 可以一次声明两个有意义的变量名 | 变量名可以自定义，但对应顺序不能改变 |\n| 示例 2 | 从 `std::get<N>()`、数组下标改为统一解包 | `auto [a,b,c] = tuple`、`auto [a,b,c] = array` | C++17 对 tuple 和数组采用相似语法 | 变量个数必须和 tuple、数组的元素个数一致 |\n| 示例 3 | 从 `.成员名` 改为解包结构体 | `auto [x,y,z] = struct_obj` | C++17 按结构体成员声明顺序绑定 | 可绑定的成员需要满足访问条件，且顺序由结构体定义决定 |\n| 示例 4 | 对比 C++17 前后的 map 写法 | `auto [it, ok] = m.insert(...)`、`[name, score]` | 返回值和 map 元素都能直接取出并命名 | `insert` 返回 `pair<iterator, bool>` |",
      "translatedText": "| Example | What was explained | Newly introduced syntax | Why it is written this way | Notes |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| Example 1 | From `pair.first/second` changed to destructuring the pair | `auto [value, ok] = pair` | C++17 can declare two meaningful variable names at once | Variable names can be customized, but the corresponding order cannot be changed |\n| Example 2 | From `std::get<N>()` and array indexing changed to unified destructuring | `auto [a,b,c] = tuple`、`auto [a,b,c] = array` | C++17 uses similar syntax for tuples and arrays | The number of variables must match the number of elements in the tuple or array |\n| Example 3 | From `.成员名` changed to destructuring a struct | `auto [x,y,z] = struct_obj` | C++17 binds in the order in which struct members are declared | The bindable members must satisfy access conditions, and the order is determined by the struct definition |\n| Example 4 | Compare the map syntax before and after C++17 | `auto [it, ok] = m.insert(...)`、`[name, score]` | Return values and map elements can both be extracted and named directly | `insert` returns `pair<iterator, bool>` |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 323,
        "outputTokens": 219,
        "costUsd": 0.00036
      }
